# Paris Ouverte

French-first civic dashboard. Three locales (`fr`, `en`, `es`), default `fr`, always-on URL prefixes (`/fr`, `/en`, `/es`). Do not translate Open Data record values. Brand **Paris Ouverte** stays.

- Next.js 16 App Router + React 19 + Tailwind 4. Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before using Next APIs. Use `proxy.ts`, not `middleware.ts`.
- Auth: Better Auth email/password. DB: Drizzle + SQLite (`data/dashboard.sqlite`, gitignored).
- Public: `/` redirects to `/fr`; auth at `/[locale]/login`, `/[locale]/signup`. Private: `/[locale]/dashboard/*`. APIs stay unprefixed (`/api/*`).
- Theme pages: KPI strip + map and/or chart + searchable table. Two datasets on one theme use tabs, not extra routes.
- Reuse `components/ui` (`Button`, `Card`, `Input`, `Heading`, plus owned shadcn copies for Table/Badge/Pagination/Dialog/Select) and tokens in `app/globals.css` (`navy`, `ground`, `paper`, `accent`). Do not add a third-party visual kit (MUI, Chakra, etc.); restyle shadcn copies to square geometry and Paris red. Typography: Newsreader (display) + IBM Plex Sans (UI). Storybook: `pnpm storybook`.
- Product intent: `PLAN.md`. Dataset catalog: `lib/opendata/datasets.ts`.
- Do not commit or push unless asked. Do not commit `.env*` or `data/`.
